r my life.\"","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"89:25","t":"So on that Day, none will punish [as severely] as His punishment,","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"89:26","t":"And none will bind [as severely] as His binding [of the evildoers].","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"89:27","t":"[To the righteous it will be said], \"O reassured soul,","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"89:28","t":"Return to your Lord, well-pleased and pleasing [to Him],","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"89:29","t":"And enter among My [righteous] servants","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"89:30","t":"And enter My Paradise.\"","j":30,"h":60,"s":89,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"90:1","t":"I swear by this city [i.e., Makkah]","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"90:2","t":"And you, [O Muḥammad], are free of restriction in this city","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"90:3","t":"And [by] the father and that which was born [of him],","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"90:4","t":"We have certainly created man into hardship.","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"90:5","t":"Does he think that never will anyone overcome him?","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"90:6","t":"He says, \"I have spent wealth in abundance.\"","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"90:7","t":"Does he think that no one has seen him?","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"90:8","t":"Have We not made for him two eyes?","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"90:9","t":"And a tongue and two lips?","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"90:10","t":"And have shown him the two ways?","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"90:11","t":"But he has not broken through the difficult pass.","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"90:12","t":"And what can make you know what is [breaking through] the difficult pass?","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"90:13","t":"It is the freeing of a slave","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"90:14","t":"Or feeding on a day of severe hunger","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"90:15","t":"An orphan of near relationship","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"90:16","t":"Or a needy person in misery","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"90:17","t":"And then being among those who believed and advised one another to patience and advised one another to compassion.","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"90:18","t":"Those are the companions of the right.","j":30,"h":60,"s":90,"a":18,"sd":null}],"juz":30,"hizb":60,"surahs":[89,90],"sajdah":false}